dor of Subterranean Gardens\"</a>. <i id=\"mw4A\">Los Angeles Times</i>. August 13, 1989.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Los+Angeles+Times&amp;rft.atitle=Buried+Treasure%3A+A+Legal+Battle+Soils+the+Splendor+of+Subterranean+Gardens&amp;rft.date=1989-08-13&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.latimes.com%2Farchives%2Fla-xpm-1989-08-13-mn-832-story.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AForestiere+Underground+Gardens\" about=\"#mwt41\" id=\"mw4Q\"></span></span></li>\n<li about=\"#cite_note-Forestiere_Historical_Center-8\" id=\"cite_note-Forestiere_Historical_Center-8\" data-mw-footnote-number=\"8\"><span id=\"mw4g\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Forestiere_Historical_Center_8-0\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\" id=\"mw4w\"><span id=\"mw5A\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Forestiere_Historical_Center-8\"><cite about=\"#mwt44\" id=\"mw5g\"><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130414120905/http://forestiere-historicalcenter.com/Undergroundwonders.html\" id=\"mw5w\">\"Underground - Forestiere Historical Center\"</a>. April 14, 2013. Archived from <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"http://forestiere-historicalcenter.com/undergroundwonders.html\" id=\"mw6A\">the original</a> on April 14, 2013.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Underground+-+Forestiere+Historical+Center&amp;rft.date=2013-04-14&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fforestiere-historicalcenter.com%2Fundergroundwonders.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AForestiere+Underground+Gardens\" about=\"#mwt44\" id=\"mw6Q\"></span></span></li>\n<li about=\"#cite_note-Forestiere_Underground_Gardens-9\" id=\"cite_note-Forestiere_Underground_Gardens-9\" data-mw-footnote-number=\"9\"><span id=\"mw6g\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Forestiere_Underground_Gardens_9-0\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\" id=\"mw6